cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "weathernext3-forecast: bounding-box WeatherNext 3 forecasts as NetCDF"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tool and Colab notebook that download Google WeatherNext 3
  gridded weather forecasts for a bounding box from Google Earth Engine and
  write them as CF-style NetCDF files, with correct valid-time labelling and
  native-grid alignment.
